          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "For the purposes of sections 199(1)(c)(i)(C), 200(1)(a)(iii), 201(3)(a)(iii), 203(1)(a)(ii) and 204(3)(a)(ii), the total income shall be computed without any deduction or exemption, under the following provisions:—",
